<title>USA: Iomega names vice president of research.</title>
<headline>Iomega names vice president of research.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega Corp named Douglas Clifford as vice president of research and development and chief technology officer.</p>
<p>Clifford was previously a research and development manager at Hewlett-Packard Co, Iomega said.</p>
